WEBVTT

00:03.640 --> 00:08.270
Welcome! Sonico, it's all
tuned up and ready to go!

00:08.930 --> 00:10.519
Thank you very much!

00:10.520 --> 00:15.650
You always play with such power.
I tuned it to be more in line with that!

00:15.860 --> 00:20.610
Oh! And I traded out the pickup for
one that will bring out more of that power!

00:20.900 --> 00:22.700
Thank you so much!

00:28.290 --> 00:29.290
AH!

00:29.291 --> 00:31.630
Up Close and Personal
With No. 1 Model
Ruka Sakai!!
Photo Shoot Insert
Exclusive, All-New Photos
Super Sonico

00:29.660 --> 00:30.750
That's...

00:31.080 --> 00:33.670
Oh yeah, it comes out this week!

00:34.000 --> 00:38.010
Wow, Okinawa! I'd like to
wear a bikini like this, too!

00:38.300 --> 00:40.419
The model's really pretty, huh?

00:40.420 --> 00:41.420
Huh?

00:41.510 --> 00:43.510
Aren't those boobs a bit big?

00:44.550 --> 00:46.759
Oh? I think they're great.

00:46.760 --> 00:48.930
It's not quite what I go for.

00:53.100 --> 00:54.400
Thank you very much.

01:00.690 --> 01:02.780
Thank you for buying that!

